    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"### Summary and Conclusions\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Key Findings:**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"1. **Dataset Characteristics:**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - 41,188 samples with 20 features (excluding target)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - Highly imbalanced: ~11% positive class (term deposit subscribers)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - No missing values, mix of categorical and numerical features\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"2. **Model Performance:**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - All models significantly outperform baseline (most frequent = 88.9% accuracy)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - ROC AUC is the most appropriate metric due to class imbalance\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - Hyperparameter tuning generally improves performance\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"3. **Best Performing Models:**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - Logistic Regression and SVM typically achieve highest ROC AUC scores\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - Decision Trees can be competitive after tuning\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - KNN tends to have lower performance on this dataset\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"4. **Feature Insights:**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - Economic indicators (euribor3m, employment rate) are important predictors\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - Contact history and campaign features provide valuable information\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - Duration feature excluded to avoid data leakage in realistic deployment\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"5. **Business Recommendations:**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - Use the best-performing model to prioritize customer contacts\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - Consider threshold tuning based on business costs of false positives/negatives\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - Monitor economic indicators as they strongly influence subscription likelihood\\n\",\n",
    "    \"   - Focus campaigns during favorable economic conditions\"\n",
